<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends down on funds,cocoa and sugar up.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends down on funds,cocoa and sugar up.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Ends down on fund profit-taking. July down $135 at $2,465.</p>
<p>COCOA - Ends up. July closes above resistance, mood turns up. July up six at 1,038.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Up, back months lead gains. Supply fears linger. Aug up 0.2 at 324.10 at 1600 GMT.</p>
</text>
